@RagServer.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228

### Ingest files from the configured KnowledgeBasePath
POST {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ingest
Accept: application/json

###

### Ask a question using retrieved context + Ollama generation
POST {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "What are the main responsibilities of this API?",
  "model": "qwen2.5-coder:14b"
}

###

### Get configured chat models and default model
GET {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/models
Accept: application/json

###

### Clear all indexed RAG data
DELETE {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/data
Accept: application/json

###
